      "parameters": {
        "width": 688,
        "height": 608,
        "content": "## How it works\n\nThis workflow automatically performs AI-powered internet research based on a topic provided by the user. It generates smart search queries using AI, searches articles from the internet, reads full article content using Jina AI Reader, and cleans unnecessary text from the articles. The workflow then summarizes each article with AI, extracts important insights, compares findings across multiple sources, and generates a professional research report. Finally, the report is converted into a PDF file and automatically sent to the user through email.\n\n## Setup steps\n\n**1.** Add your OpenAI API credentials for AI processing and summarization.\n**2.** Configure the Google Search API or search provider credentials.\n**3.** Add the Jina AI Reader URL setup for reading full article content.\n**4.** Configure the PDF generation service/API credentials.\n**5.** Connect your Gmail account for sending the final report email.\n**6.** Update the webhook URL and send a research topic in the request body.\n**7.** Test the workflow with a sample research topic and verify email delivery."
